GAL trans is a Moldovan carrier company that operates regular bus services from Moldova to Romania, Ukraine and Russia.

With the application from GAL Trans you can easily:
– choose a flight suitable for the requested date;
– check buses routes on the map;
– see buses’ photos;
– make a reservation with payment to the driver during the boarding;
– pay for the ticket online;
– get access to the history of all purchased tickets in the personal account
– make a quick ticket return in your personal account
– request information from support service.

GAL Trans has a large bus fleet that meets European standards.

The professional drivers team will make sure that your trip is as comfortable as possible.

GAL Trans - it's important, who you travel with!

Explore Romania step by step and discover its stories with the help of the Attractive Romania platform – the most comprehensive guide to stories and legends about Romanian destinations.

Download the app for free and embark on the exploration of lesser-known cultural landmarks, which hold immense historical and heritage value for Romania and all of Europe.

From castles shrouded in mystery, churches and monasteries steeped in spirituality, to secluded houses in the fishing villages of the Danube Delta or the rich traditional gastronomy – all will present Romania to you as you've never seen it before, like a territory woven from thousands of unique stories waiting to be discovered.

Discover each attraction along the 12 thematic routes and enjoy the mosaic of multimedia materials, gathered on each attraction's presentation page:
 - Text Information: learn the place's story through unique historical details, legends, and experiences;
 - Video: take a first look and immerse yourself in the atmosphere of the place;
 - Photo Gallery: see the attraction in various angles through photographs;
 - Audio Guide: embark on a revealing journey around the attraction, following the guide's instructions through your own headphones;
3D Animation: step into the attraction's past – see the faithful reconstruction of the building and take part in a historic moment, alongside great figures from the past;
 - Virtual Tour: explore every corner and discover unknown details about the main points of interest.

What you can do in the Attractive Romania app:
 - Navigate through lists of attractions grouped into the 12 thematic routes, including offline access;
 - Get better oriented by checking the interactive map;
 - Find what you're looking for more easily by filtering according to various criteria: county, distance, alphabetical order, or rating;
 - Follow the attraction's page to stay updated whenever there are news;
 - Add the attraction to your own itinerary or lists and start exploring whenever you have the opportunity;
 - Read push notifications and stay informed about everything happening throughout the country;
 - Get inspired by recommendation articles so you don't miss anything interesting;
 - Make the most of your journey and take part in cultural events from the dedicated section;
 - Search for content in multiple languages: Romanian and English;
 - Provide reviews to help other tourists discover how your experience was;
 - Explore even more attractions around the main attraction by viewing the list of related attractions nearby.

